[38;2;124;124;124mNow we need to find the fixed field. By Lüroth's theorem, the fixed field is $[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\mathbb{F}_2(u)$ for some rational function $u$. The degree $[\mathbb{F}_2(t) : [0m[38;2;124;124;124m\mathbb{F}_2(u)] = |G| = 6$.[0m

