[38;2;124;124;124mLet me first verify the identity $\frac{(t^4-t)^3}{(t^2-t)^5} = [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\frac{(t^2+t+1)^3}{(t^2-t)^2}$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$t^4 - t = t(t^3 - 1) = t(t-1)(t^2+t+1)$. In $\mathbb{F}_2$, $t-1 = t+1$, so [0m
