[38;2;124;124;124mextension $[\mathbb{F}_2(t):\mathbb{F}_2(u)]$ equals $\max(\deg \text{num}, \deg[0m[38;2;124;124;124m\text{denom}) = 6$ (when the rational function is written in lowest terms, which[0m[38;2;124;124;124mit is since $t^2+t+1$ is irreducible over $\mathbb{F}_2$ and coprime to [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$t(t+1)$).[0m

